  "id": "sum-strategy",
  "term": "sum strategy",
  "definition": "In this image-fusion method, a sum strategy means creating the fused saliency component by simply adding together the saliency components from each input image. It is used as a straightforward way to combine salient information from multiple imaging modalities.",
